OL,3,GNEWSAHands-on lessons prepare students
OL,4,Afor work
OL,5,
OL,6,FPractical lessons help students prepare
OL,7,Ffor future careers students at a
OL,8,Fvocational training centre have said.
OL,10,FKenny and Will attend a woodworking
OL,11,Fworkshop at The Spark Group in
OL,12,FStoke-on-Trent, learning how to create
OL,13,Fdovetail joints before progressing to
OL,14,Fplumbing, electrical work and other
OL,15,Ftrades.
OL,17,F"It was a struggle at first but as I
OL,18,Fhave got on it's become a lot easier,"
OL,19,FKenny said.
