OL,3,GNEWSAHands-on lessons prepare students
OL,4,Afor work
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe teenager welcomed government plans
OL,7,Fto expand vocational education in
OL,8,FEngland, saying it would give more
OL,9,Fyoung people the chance to learn
OL,10,Fpractical skills. Prime Minister Andy
OL,11,FBurnham announced earlier this year
OL,12,Fthat he wanted Britain to "value the
OL,13,Fhard hat every bit as much as the
OL,14,Fgraduation cap."
